bai1_email_masking

1. Du lieu dau vao 
email = input(" Nhap dia chi Email: ")

2. Dung split de tach ten voi mien 
username, domain = email.split("@")

3. Trich xuat 3 ky tu dau 
first_3_character = username[0:3]

4. Ghep 3 ky tu dau + "***@" + ten mien 
masked_email = f"{first_3_character}***@{domain}

5. In ket qua ra mang hinh
print(" Email sau khi bao mat:", masked_email)